        "quality:docs"
      ],
      "reason": "Gian Tool contracts cross shared validation, role/direct-ownership authorization, Host domain orchestration, private transports, Session-scoped Host Service injection, worktree view context, and the Codex runtime adapter."
    },
    {
      "id": "host-process-git-runtime",
